    "kv_cache_management": "RadixAttention's radix tree organizes KV cache by consecutive token spans; HiCache extends it to a HiRadixTree across L1/L2/L3 tiers (GPU, host memory, external storage) with prefetch and write-back policies. v0.5.19 makes the unified radix tree the cache for every model, not just hybrid ones (listed as a breaking change). HiSparse offloads DSA-model KV to host memory.",
    "prefix_caching": "Radix-tree prefix caching (RadixAttention): KV cache of shared prefixes is reused through the radix tree; eviction policies lru, lfu, slru and priority.",
    "disaggregation": "PD disaggregation separates prefill and decode with Mooncake or NIXL as transfer engines (transfer backend choices also include ascend, mori, mooncake_tcp and fake). EPD disaggregation further separates the vision encoder stage for VLMs.",
